  "query_preview": "..\nA fairly dry pattern is now in place across the Marianas, with only \na few showers seen across the region. This dry pattern looks to \ncontinue through the end of the week. By Friday night, inflow into\nInvest 91W looks to remain mostly outside of the area, however, it is\nexpected to bring an increased potential for thunderstorms to the\nMarianas. Then, during the last half of the weekend, convection \nassociated with Invest 90W looks to move into the region, increasing\nPOPs (Probability of Precipitation) into the 30 percent range across\nthe Marianas. A drier pattern is expected to return by the middle of\nnext week.",
